{"overview":"از زندگی روزمره فرار کنید در «SATISFY»، بازی واقعیت مجازی که بازیکنان در آن شهرت و ثروت واقعی به دست می‌آورند. یک بازیکن به نام گرید نمی‌تواند در بازی یا زندگی واقعی موفق شود؛ اما همه چیز وقتی که یک مأموریت چالش‌برانگیز او را به وارث شدن یک آهنگر افسانه‌ای تبدیل می‌کند، تغییر می‌کند. آمارهای او به صفر باز می‌گردد، اما او در حال ارتقاء و ساخت کالاهای خدایانه است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Escape everyday life in SATISFY, a VR game where players earn real-world fame and fortune. One player, Grid, can't seem to catch a break in the game or in real life. That all changes when a challenging quest leads him to becoming the heir to a legendary blacksmith. His stats are reset to zero, but he's leveling up and crafting some seriously god-tier goods.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/fmAQ2lOtLAoEU2p6wQ12wXbIgLM.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP","KR"],"cast":[{"name":"橘龍丸","role":"Shin Youngwoo / Grid (voice)","photo":"/eShhW1W22SQuUwRaONnpzEZ5w6E.jpg","en":"Tatsumaru Tachibana"},{"name":"瀬戸麻沙美","role":"Yura (voice)","photo":"/iKKCPgKrNd4pJ0iBOC1SBZy2Y4Y.jpg","en":"Asami Seto"},{"name":"福積沙耶","role":"Euphemia (voice)","photo":"/zlSTVQsai4DcvHimLo8r4dg8DhG.jpg","en":"Saya Fukuzumi"},{"name":"高山俊太朗","role":"Huroi (voice)","photo":"/eAMybCcZcukliA30Qb0UNR7ZQnh.jpg","en":"Shuntaro Takayama"},{"name":"杉山里穂","role":"Jishuka (voice)","photo":"/rPVn4cInZVECBWhoHozERc8XTTj.jpg","en":"Riho Sugiyama"},{"name":"水中雅章","role":"Toban (voice)","photo":"/cHb2pr4juxk8A3VTuDxgPWHM6WF.jpg","en":"Masaaki Mizunaka"},{"name":"盆子原康","role":"Regas (voice)","photo":"/ArR2Pkddx548PV71sZ1mBJ2RXd1.jpg","en":"Ko Bonkobara"},{"name":"福西勝也","role":"Vantner (voice)","photo":"/8paIbTobS6266x57pIhJCq3mBJh.jpg","en":"Masaya Fukunishi"},{"name":"天﨑滉平","role":"Pon (voice)","photo":"/tnN5jLiLjcDa7qn88uLb1iAfivL.jpg","en":"Kohei Amasaki"},{"name":"土岐隼一","role":"Faker (voice)","photo":"/3